      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "5. The Commissioner  Thiruchengode Municipality, No.1,\n Velur Road, Near Town Police Station,\n Thiruchengode Town,\n Namakkal District-637 211.\n \n Prayer : Writ Petition is filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of  praying for issuance of a Writ of Declaration to declare that the reserv  made for the proposed 100 feet Road in respect of the petitioner's land  situated at ward G, Block No.37, Thiruchengode Town, Comprised   T.S.No.4/2, has lapsed in terms of section 38 of the Tamil Nadu Town and  Country Planning Act, 1971, and consequently to direct the respondents t  issue appropriate orders releasing the Petitioners' property, which form  of 'Modified Master Plan for Thiruchengode local planning area', approve",
