      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "For Petitioners: Mr. Senthil S  For Respondent: Mrs. C.Meera Arumugham, AGP  ORDER",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2700,
      "end": 2783,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Senthil S",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 2722,
          "end": 2731
        },
        {
          "text": "C.Meera Arumugham",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 2754,
          "end": 2771
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The petitioners are the owners of the land situated in T.S.No.4, S.No.311/3B, Tiruchengode village and town comprised in Ward no. G, Block no.37 to an extent of 41 cents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2784,
      "end": 2954,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Tiruchengode village",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2862,
          "end": 2882
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "The petitioners had purchased the property from one P.Madheswaran and his children by way of a registered document on 09.12.2022.\n2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2955,
      "end": 3087,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "P.Madheswaran",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3007,
          "end": 3020
        },
        {
          "text": "09.12.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3073,
          "end": 3083
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The area of purchase was a subject matter of reservation for a road under the 'Master Plan for Tiruchengode Town'.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3088,
      "end": 3202,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Tiruchengode Town",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3183,
          "end": 3200
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "To that effect, the reservation was made in terms of Section 36 of the Tamil Nadu Town and Country Planning Act, 1971 (hereinafter referred to as 'the Act, 1971') by way of G.O.Ms.No.40, Housing and Urban Development (UD-4) Department, dated 27.02.2008.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3203,
      "end": 3456,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 36",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3256,
          "end": 3266
        },
        {
          "text": "Tamil Nadu Town and Country Planning Act, 1971",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3274,
          "end": 3320
        },
        {
          "text": "27.02.2008",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3445,
          "end": 3455
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "The petitioners allege that no acquisition either under the Land Acquisition Act, 1894 or the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act,\n2013 was initiated by __________ https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3457,
      "end": 3717,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Land Acquisition Act, 1894",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3517,
          "end": 3543
        },
        {
          "text": "Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act,\n2013",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3551,
          "end": 3657
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "( Uploaded on: 07/11/2025 01:23:52 pm ) the respondents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 3718,
      "end": 3774,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "07/11/2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3733,
          "end": 3743
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Hence, relying upon Section 38 of the Act, 1971, they seek for a declaration that the lands are deemed to have been released from the public purpose contemplated under Section 36 of the Act, 1971.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3775,
      "end": 3971,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 38",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3795,
          "end": 3805
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 36",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3943,
          "end": 3953
        },
        {
          "text": "Act, 1971",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3961,
          "end": 3970
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "3. When the matter came up for admission, Mrs. C.Meera Arumugham, learned Additional Government Pleader, took notice for the respondents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 3973,
      "end": 4110,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "C.Meera Arumugham",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 4020,
          "end": 4037
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "On instructions, she reports that pursuant to the notification of the Modified Master Plan in 2008, no further steps have been initiated to acquire the land.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4111,
      "end": 4268,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "4. Once the notification is issued under Section 36 of the Act, 1971, then the Town and Country Planning Act deems the area reserved as being required for public purpose.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4270,
      "end": 4440,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 36",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4311,
          "end": 4321
        },
        {
          "text": "Act, 1971",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4329,
          "end": 4338
        },
        {
          "text": "Town and Country Planning Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4349,
          "end": 4378
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Under Section 37 of the Act, 1971, the local planning authorities have a period of three years to either negotiate and purchase the property or resort to compulsory acquisition and take over the title of the same.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4441,
      "end": 4654,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 37",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4447,
          "end": 4457
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "In case the resort to Section 37 of the Act is not adopted within a period of three years, then the reservation, by virtue of Section 38 of the Act, 1971, is deemed to have lapsed and the property stands released from such reservation.\n5.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 4655,
      "end": 4893,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 37",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4677,
          "end": 4687
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 38",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4781,
          "end": 4791
        },
        {
          "text": "Act, 1971",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4799,
          "end": 4808
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "As Mrs.C.Meera Arumugham states that, no acquisition proceedings have taken place, Section 38 of the Act, 1971 automatically applies, as three _________",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 4894,
      "end": 5046,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "C.Meera Arumugham",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 4901,
          "end": 4918
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 38",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4977,
          "end": 4987
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "_ https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 5047,
      "end": 5080,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "(\nUploaded on: 07/11/2025 01:23:52 pm ) years period had lapsed as early as 2011.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 5081,
      "end": 5162,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "07/11/2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 5096,
          "end": 5106
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "Consequently, it is declared that the reservation made over the petitioners' property for 100 feet road is deemed to have lapsed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 5163,
      "end": 5292,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "6. In view of the above, the writ petition stands allowed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 5294,
      "end": 5352,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "No costs.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 5353,
      "end": 5362,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
